"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ahh... ⟪k:4⟫thank you very much. Blessings upon you.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫May the Lord "
"bless your soul, young sire."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ahh... ⟪k:4⟫grazie infinite. Che voi siate lodato.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Possa il Signore "
