#: scenario:scenario_3DC3D75D_8477_449F_9C3C_84273E47D26F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c455ab223eb9b3af0aa05b6421fb8a407e6ba5e4e0df7a5286a461891925a78
