msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DC3D75D_8477_449F_9C3C_84273E47D26F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sun shone fiercely down on the town that day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quel giorno il sole splendeva intensamente sulla città."

#: scenario:scenario_88CB335D_5BA8_4A7E_BE8C_72DA907A5FA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27598269e78060506d68cd6ad2ebf0f5f127e7ddfd09ed9b5ff37ee177abaa77
#. default-sha256: 9e77228dbffa5a466d0500e0e4dcdcb229083e747ed189ab55824c0dd08c92d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88CB335D_5BA8_4A7E_BE8C_72DA907A5FA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As was characteristic of the area, cloudy days and rain were frequent during this season, "
"but the sun almost always took the stage the day after a storm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com’era tipico dell’area, le giornate nuvolose e le piogge erano frequenti durante quella "
"stagione, ma il sole faceva capolino quasi sempre il giorno successivo a una tempesta."

#: scenario:scenario_B1972126_9191_470D_8CD6_E8E1A37076AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8faca5f8e368bae61784ad75e4ee4d1be52d51bccc181c9fad8846854182ded7
#. default-sha256: ba583d7a2bb75f1e9c594214d6270478d5c0552efd6d3803ce2032c037c16249
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B1972126_9191_470D_8CD6_E8E1A37076AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cathedral standing tall in the center of town.⟪k:1⟫The stone-paved streets clacking with "
"the pleasant sound of footsteps.⟪k:2⟫The people peering out from beneath awnings to look up at "
"the sky."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’alta cattedrale situata al centro della città.⟪k:1⟫ Le strade lastricate di pietra che "
"risuonavano del piacevole rumore dei passi.⟪k:2⟫ La gente che sbirciava da dietro le tende per "
"osservare il cielo."

#: scenario:scenario_FA7DB5A1_352F_468E_9A39_B7387CAAB96F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98799fac343d41c82e241873b1af99d55187aba2bf5124817ebfc1b1cf39eb34
