msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Elsewhere—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫back at the mansion,⟪k:9⟫Nellie was "
"causing trouble for the abigails."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Nel frattempo, ⟪k:7⟫alla villa,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Nellie stava causando "
"problemi alle domestiche."

#: scenario:scenario_56FADCA6_47A7_43DC_AE0D_3762B6682432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 630d9f4b9315de6aa0e42815c35697129e5624760879e74141bd346a112ca5f1
#. default-sha256: a34d2bff7a16a432251c8fd11636e80071b1dbe924f0c7578b9787ae22a61503
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56FADCA6_47A7_43DC_AE0D_3762B6682432"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On a whim, she had decided to redecorate her bedchamber, so she gathered the maids and put "
"them to work, shouting orders and demands and complaints."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per un capriccio, aveva deciso di ridecorare la propria camera da letto,⟪k:1⟫così radunò le "
"servitrici della casa e le mise al lavoro, urlando ordini, richieste e lamentele."

#: scenario:scenario_7BF2CCDF_724E_4FC0_A216_50B4B754228A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9607917bd9330bdcb60e5c0c246a591e07e7eb5309b38c153dbbcb3cc78dc6f6
#. default-sha256: 8c1b27e92d5c0d00375f7ccd9c183104c9db3f8b634b5a4395b490792a87483d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7BF2CCDF_724E_4FC0_A216_50B4B754228A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And she had not summoned only her personal servants, but others as well—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫including "
"the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E non aveva chiamato solo le sue ancelle personali, ma anche altre—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫inclusa la "
"Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi."

#: scenario:scenario_2649E325_FADA_41C0_BA9D_34CD2CFE9BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04cc0bce0a60514e2821f8fccc82777567a795f6fc736f299b082f5266072cdb
#. default-sha256: 368504a226c65721f57e04118d69b5626f9070818b3d0b23d2418d3d3136a029
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2649E325_FADA_41C0_BA9D_34CD2CFE9BD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫No, not like that! How many times must I tell you?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫No, non così! Quante volte devo ripetervelo?!"

#: scenario:scenario_7028109B_CC5D_4B0E_9059_F147BB0704AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 829ce375088173e25359db6941518073b97fb5956c995315936ae2f19c37b834
#. default-sha256: 52d85e71711c854e07e346557e946d8056b2f1ba81da09e3d06ff93d7634b5a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7028109B_CC5D_4B0E_9059_F147BB0704AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tapestry goes by the door!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And I ⟪k:3⟫don’t⟪k:4⟫ like the carpet’s pattern.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Is there anything else we can change it with?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La tappezzeria passa vicino alla porta!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E ⟪k:3⟫non mi piace⟪k:4⟫ il modello del "
"tappeto.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫C’è qualcos’altro con cui possiamo cambiarlo?"

#: scenario:scenario_7C0F1664_0F95_4494_82E9_FB82AF0BF61F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4458bc1a0893ed68aedfd202ca8c3720b53794ba5c527adecf0332dfe754cd5
#. default-sha256: 3c35d3ef2af7fc21071cfcd2a274e1fde7bf4caeb9ff9f59e7c1e402ddec54b8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C0F1664_0F95_4494_82E9_FB82AF0BF61F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hey! Who put this ugly vase here?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ehi! Chi ha messo qui quest’orribile vaso?!"

#: scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a75cdd0650b41774854b354b71e5a144c4020c54882bb455bae5e7b93d9a30e
#. default-sha256: 62fd3242d26c94ac5be2d95035ea9f91cd7f7cbd98e0c1894ceb831b65f7006e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie appeared to be rather irritated,⟪k:1⟫and it was the servants who bore the brunt of "
"her frustration.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Though if they found this similarly vexing, none of them showed it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie sembrava piuttosto irritata.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E i servi, vittime della sua frustrazione, "
"erano probabilmente altrettanto contrariati, sebbene non lo mostrassero."

#: scenario:scenario_B0F5D658_7174_46B8_A984_470265C4D59B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ae9eca5eb6fe5a73c683f5afd00f081a9763a4dcef1e8f80a0ce758022f9f47
#. default-sha256: bea2f4950715cc2fb960f985741729722efa3c670e3bd455bff34acde8f0f21c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B0F5D658_7174_46B8_A984_470265C4D59B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was a girl who spoke her mind—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a trait particular to that time in history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era una ragazza che diceva sempre ciò che pensava—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫un tratto caratteristico di "
"quel periodo storico."

#: scenario:scenario_9DBE7CEF_0E98_4C69_8035_7BECFBEB1317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d0bafa00008bb668151b1349f2929eb22832887867ac6468dbe52f35e2aecc8
#. default-sha256: 5c37a4a007c8504462e9d8fec3d4e90c8abde5f21339e02c37d8dc535d84f915
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9DBE7CEF_0E98_4C69_8035_7BECFBEB1317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Women of the Golden Age were so vivacious, in fact, that it inspired parody and satire in "
"foreign countries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Infatti, le donne dell’Età dell’Oro erano così vivaci da ispirare parodie e satire nei Paesi "
"stranieri."

#: scenario:scenario_DE2AD71D_EB41_4E77_A7F5_41BCAD4443BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f42daeea78c146a5f29247d6dd458f5579521be040f7c90aa84bdf9f453bbeb
#. default-sha256: 194175c2972fb26e431f7fad7d337ff084936efa9817ec212c52dea38d765647
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DE2AD71D_EB41_4E77_A7F5_41BCAD4443BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But no matter how hands-off her parents were, had Nellie been born a generation earlier, or "
"a generation later, she likely would not have been able to act so free-spirited."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non aveva importanza quanto fossero distanti i suoi genitori—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫che Nellie fosse "
"nata una generazione prima, o una generazione dopo, probabilmente non sarebbe stata in grado di "
"agire in modo così libero."

#: scenario:scenario_D1740DA2_CFCF_433A_8C24_6D6576850280
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0993978ced48695a0ee7821be382a1bbcd795e3449871ab0ce186be30ffd3bda
#. default-sha256: 3d53fcd7e238fa2dcac0a3e8c953d0c8063e17c2834f3f7b5c88f054d5598c63
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1740DA2_CFCF_433A_8C24_6D6576850280"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That day, however, Nellie did not seem to be her usual self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quel giorno, tuttavia, Nellie non sembrava essere la stessa di sempre."

#: scenario:scenario_468503C1_9784_4B30_B1E4_062C10ED29C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3667ac7e58e859371d8349e7cb3bf93ec7be8ae3f9ec3e743f00d982de0a53ef
#. default-sha256: a1322bc5e481f97a2a08c404661285cfcf543a2c011829d1c2cff409376c76bc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_468503C1_9784_4B30_B1E4_062C10ED29C6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though she always spoke her mind, it rarely went beyond being childishly adorable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante desse sempre voce ai propri pensieri, raramente andava⟪k:1⟫al di là dell’essere "
"infantilmente adorabile."

#: scenario:scenario_953508C8_91FC_4CF5_BD8E_03E705D4C54D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f06ecb6537ac90097ca6605b4fca93012e727a432b930b695663b848e85e99f3
#. default-sha256: d87f37fc20fb0c182eb9e9e0d184eca77a17e34262ac579ae778c98fddd8bd78
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_953508C8_91FC_4CF5_BD8E_03E705D4C54D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was unusual to see her in such a foul mood, not even a smile on her face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era raro vederla di cattivo umore, senza nemmeno un sorriso sul volto."

#: scenario:scenario_A206F73E_4111_4666_B544_2A105B09EF95
